# 🖼️ IMAGE URL STANDARDS - NEVER USE BLOCKED URLs

## ⛔ NEVER USE THESE URL SOURCES (THEY GET BLOCKED)
- **wikipedia.org** - Wikipedia blocks external image requests
- **wikimedia.org** - Wikimedia Commons blocks external requests  
- **.svg** files - AsyncImage doesn't render SVG properly
- Any URL that requires authentication
- Any URL with CORS restrictions

## ✅ ALWAYS USE THESE RELIABLE IMAGE SOURCES
When setting `logoURL`, `thumbnailURL`, `posterURL`, or any image URL:

### YouTube Thumbnails (PREFERRED)
```
https://i.ytimg.com/vi/{VIDEO_ID}/hqdefault.jpg
https://i.ytimg.com/vi/{VIDEO_ID}/maxresdefault.jpg
```

### Other Reliable CDNs
- `imgur.com` - Imgur images
- `cloudinary.com` - Cloudinary CDN
- `googleusercontent.com` - Google CDN
- `akamaized.net` - Akamai CDN
- `cloudfront.net` - AWS CloudFront
- `pluto.tv` - Pluto TV images
- `image.tmdb.org` - TMDB movie images
- `m.media-amazon.com` - Amazon images

### Direct Image Extensions (OK if from reliable hosts)
- `.jpg` / `.jpeg`
- `.png`
- `.webp`
- `.gif`

## 🔥 LIVE TV CHANNEL RULES
When creating `LiveTVChannel` objects:

1. **logoURL**: MUST be a YouTube thumbnail or reliable CDN
2. **previewFallbackURL**: ALWAYS provide Apple test stream as fallback:
   ```
   https://devstreaming-cdn.apple.com/videos/streaming/examples/bipbop_16x9/bipbop_16x9_variant.m3u8
   ```

### ✅ CORRECT Example
```swift
LiveTVChannel(
    id: "channel-id",
    name: "Channel Name",
    logoURL: "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VIDEOID123/hqdefault.jpg", // ✅ YouTube thumbnail
    streamURL: plutoURL("pluto-channel-id"),
    category: .entertainment,
    description: "Channel description",
    isLive: true,
    viewerCount: 100000,
    quality: "1080p",
    language: "English",
    country: "US",
    epgURL: nil,
    previewFallbackURL: "https://devstreaming-cdn.apple.com/videos/streaming/examples/bipbop_16x9/bipbop_16x9_variant.m3u8" // ✅ Always include
)
```

### ❌ WRONG Example (Will show missing thumbnails)
```swift
LiveTVChannel(
    id: "channel-id", 
    name: "Channel Name",
    logoURL: "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/logo.svg", // ❌ Wikipedia URL
    streamURL: plutoURL("pluto-channel-id"),
    // ... 
    previewFallbackURL: nil // ❌ No fallback
)
```

## 🔍 VALIDATION CHECKLIST
Before adding any image URL:
- [ ] Is it NOT from wikipedia.org or wikimedia.org?
- [ ] Is it NOT an .svg file?
- [ ] Is it from a reliable CDN (YouTube, Cloudinary, etc.)?
- [ ] Does the URL end in .jpg, .jpeg, .png, .webp, or .gif?
- [ ] Have you provided a fallback URL for streaming content?

## 🛠️ HOW TO FIX BLOCKED URLs
If you find a channel with a broken image:

1. Go to YouTube and search for "{Channel Name} trailer" or "{Show Name} intro"
2. Copy the video ID from the URL (e.g., `dQw4w9WgXcQ`)
3. Use: `https://i.ytimg.com/vi/dQw4w9WgXcQ/hqdefault.jpg`

